dio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309504_fightingvoc_70\"></i></td><td>十二岁圣诞夜，嬉皮士与魔精相拥而眠。我第一次触碰到来自茸毛与爪牙的波动，它们柔和安逸，如同人们睡梦里的咕哝声。<div class=\"grey-small\">On that Christmas when I was twelve, I drifted asleep nestled with the critters.  It was the first time I felt the warmth of their fur and their gentle movements, soft and quiet— like the gentle mumbling of a dreamer. </div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"“尤提姆”新装\"></div><h2><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E5.B0.A4.E6.8F.90.E5.A7.86.E2.80.9D.E6.96.B0.E8.A3.85_New_Udimo_Outfit\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“尤提姆”新装_New_Udimo_Outfit\">“尤提姆”新装<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Udimo Outfit</span></small></span></h2><div style=\"max-width:350px; margin:10px 0;\"><img alt=\"Spine static-309504 hzsx s.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3d/Spine_static-309504_hzsx_s.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"422\" height=\"398\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"422\" data-file-height=\"398\" /></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px